{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever tried playing cards with a bear? But bears can't play cards... Well, in this incredible game you have to feel like a bear who is trying to play cards, but nothing works out for him. All he can do is smash everything around and scream GOOOOOOL!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Like a platformer, but in reverse! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the incredible gameplay at your fingertips in the vertical platformer genre, where you have to climb higher and higher, defeat enemies on your way and find out what is at the very top? And there it is...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique game based on the iconic meme about the bear! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your innermost fantasy come true and feel like a bear that crushes and breaks everything around you and screams GOOOOOL!!! \ud83d\udc3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/fab48860330a6c918c5e60c1de54880e.poster.avif?t=1771358676\" width=560 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/fab48860330a6c918c5e60c1de54880e.webm?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/fab48860330a6c918c5e60c1de54880e.mp4?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve unique puzzles and play exciting mini-games! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging and unique game that provides high-quality immersion and incredible fun for the whole day! Only 5% of people are able to solve this riddle...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/165b74f35a4fea519b669b6af253659c.poster.avif?t=1771358676\" width=560 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/165b74f35a4fea519b669b6af253659c.webm?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/165b74f35a4fea519b669b6af253659c.mp4?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME IS IN ENGLISH!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is fully translated and dubbed into English so that nothing distracts during the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push faster! GOOOOOL!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/e24c30769d4a7ce5c98680526c6cb2d3.poster.avif?t=1771358676\" width=560 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/e24c30769d4a7ce5c98680526c6cb2d3.webm?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024540/extras/e24c30769d4a7ce5c98680526c6cb2d3.mp4?t=1771358676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u041d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0435 \u0447\u0443\u0434\u043e!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024540/2d5fb85b4b76b4c8725a5eb50ecf41cadaa152fc.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3024540?t=1771358676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3024540?t=1771358676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store